<span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">31</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">31</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">21</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.4399em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;Psi_A|Psi_B&gt;/(&lt;Psi_A|0&gt;&lt;0|Psi_B&gt;)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.9701em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:14.4402em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-6.9701em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.4701em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.4701em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9401em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.4701em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1401em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.4701em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-15.7402em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.4701em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-16.9402em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.4701em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.9701em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[34]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{all T\\_a coefficients simultaneously diagonal} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{state weights} & \\begin{pmatrix}2 & 1 & 0\\\\2 & 0 & 1\\\\1 & 2 & 0\\\\1 & 0 & 2\\\\0 & 2 & 1\\\\0 & 1 & 2\\\\1 & 1 & 1\\\\1 & 1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{<0| components} & \\left\\{1,a23,a12,a12\\,a23-a13,3\\,\\left(a12\\,a23+a13\\right),3\\,a23\\,\\left(a12\\,a23+a13\\right),-2\\,a12\\,a13,-3\\,a13\\,\\left(a12\\,a23+a13\\right)\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{|0> components} & \\left\\{1,b32,b21,b21\\,b32-\\frac{b31}{2},\\frac{b31}{2},\\frac{b31\\,b32}{3},\\frac{1}{2}\\,b21\\,\\left(b21\\,b32-b31\\right),-\\frac{1}{3}\\,b31\\,\\left(b31-b21\\,b32\\right)\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{normalized vector product} & \\text{<Psi\\_A|Psi\\_B>/(<Psi\\_A|0><0|Psi\\_B>)}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "61f79a86-4ba6-4cc4-9ec1-59ac6d1fc4cf"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 3. Direct and dual Baxter Q-functions for all eight states. ---- *)\nClearAll[directReduced, dualReduced, monicKernelPolynomial,\n  pDirect, pDual, qDown, qUp, qDegrees, qChecks];\n\ndirectReduced[s_, zk_, Pf_][x_] := Expand[\n   zk nu1[x] nu1[x - h] nu1[x - 2 h] Pf[x + h]\n   - (tEigen[s, 1] /. u -> x) nu1[x - h] nu1[x - 2 h] Pf[x]\n   + (tEigen[s, 2] /. u -> x) nu1[x - 2 h] Pf[x - h]/zk\n   - (tEigen[s, 3] /. u -> x) Pf[x - 2 h]/zk^2];\n\ndualReduced[s_, zk_, Pf_][x_] := Expand[\n   nu3[x + h] nu3[x + 2 h] nu3[x + 3 h] Pf[x]\n   - (tEigen[s, 1] /. u -> x + h) nu3[x + 2 h] nu3[x + 3 h] Pf[x + h]/zk\n   + (tEigen[s, 2] /. u -> x + 2 h) nu3[x + 3 h] Pf[x + 2 h]/zk^2\n   - (tEigen[s, 3] /. u -> x + 3 h) Pf[x + 3 h]/zk^3];\n\nmonicKernelPolynomial[red_, 0] :=\n  If[FullSimplify[red[Function[y, 1]][u]] === 0, 1, $Failed];\nmonicKernelPolynomial[red_, d_Integer?Positive] :=\n Module[{c, p, residual, rows, mat, vec},\n  p = Sum[c[k] u^k, {k, 0, d}];\n  residual = Expand@Numerator@Together[\n     red[Function[y, Evaluate[p /. u -> y]]][u]];\n  rows = CoefficientList[residual, u];\n  mat = Table[Coefficient[rows[[r]], c[k]],\n    {r, Length[rows]}, {k, 0, d}];\n  vec = First[NullSpace[mat]];\n  Factor[(vec . Table[u^k, {k, 0, d}])/Last[vec]]];\n\npDirect[s_, k_] := pDirect[s, k] =\n  monicKernelPolynomial[\n   Function[pf, directReduced[s, twist[[k]], pf]],\n   2 - stateWeight[[s, k]]];\npDual[s_, k_] := pDual[s, k] =\n  monicKernelPolynomial[\n   Function[pf, dualReduced[s, twist[[k]], pf]],\n   stateWeight[[s, k]]];\n\n(* Exponential factors common to numerator and denominator are dropped. *)\nqDown[s_, k_, n_] := twist[[k]]^n (pDirect[s, k] /. u -> th + n h);\nqUp[s_, k_, n_] := twist[[k]]^(-n) (pDual[s, k] /. u -> th + n h);\n\nqDegrees = Table[\n   {s, stateWeight[[s]],\n    Table[Exponent[pDirect[s, k], u], {k, 3}],\n    Table[Exponent[pDual[s, k], u], {k, 3}]}, {s, dd}];\n\nqChecks = {\n   And @@ Flatten@Table[\n     FullSimplify[directReduced[s, twist[[k]],\n       Function[y, pDirect[s, k] /. u -> y]][u]] === 0,\n     {s, dd}, {k, 3}],\n   And @@ Flatten@Table[\n     FullSimplify[dualReduced[s, twist[[k]],\n       Function[y, pDual[s, k] /. u -> y]][u]] === 0,\n     {s, dd}, {k, 3}]};\n\nGrid[Join[\n  {{\"state\", \"weight\", \"deg P_i\", \"deg P^j\"}},\n  qDegrees,\n  {{\"all 24 direct / all 24 dual equations\", qChecks,\n    SpanFromLeft, SpanFromLeft}}\n  ], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
