\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-13.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-14.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[46]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{state} & \\text{weight} & \\text{deg P\\_i} & \\text{deg P\\^{}j}\\\\\\hline1 & \\left\\{2,1,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,1,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline2 & \\left\\{2,0,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,0,1\\right\\}\\\\\\hline3 & \\left\\{1,2,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,0,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline4 & \\left\\{1,0,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,2,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,0,2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline5 & \\left\\{0,2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,0,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,2,1\\right\\}\\\\\\hline6 & \\left\\{0,1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,1,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,1,2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline7 & \\left\\{1,1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,1,1\\right\\}\\\\\\hline8 & \\left\\{1,1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,1,1\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{all 24 direct / all 24 dual equations} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\} & {\\square} & {\\square}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "24ffc750-9a70-4ebc-a50b-0e191ffd8482"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Exact determinant normalization\n\nWrite $Q^j_n=Q^j(\\theta+nh)$. The exact coefficient of\n$\\Psi_B(\\{1\\},\\{0,0\\})$, with no auxiliary on-shell simplification imposed, is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nc_A^{\\rm ref}=\\frac{1}{4h^6}\\Big\\{&\nQ^1_{A,1}\\bigl(Q^1_{A,0}Q^2_{A,1}-Q^2_{A,0}Q^1_{A,1}\\bigr)\\\\\n&-Q^1_{A,0}\\bigl(Q^1_{A,0}Q^2_{A,2}-Q^2_{A,0}Q^1_{A,2}\\bigr)\n\\Big\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe right reference wave function is\n\n$$\n\\Psi_B^{\\rm ref}=\nQ_{B,1}(\\theta+h)\n\\left[\nQ_{B,1}(\\theta)Q_{B,2}(\\theta-h)\n-Q_{B,2}(\\theta)Q_{B,1}(\\theta-h)\n\\right].\n$$\n\nThe normalized functional scalar product is\n\n$$\n\\mathcal S_Q(A,B)=C_{\\rm vac}\\,\n\\frac{\\det N^{AB}}{c_A^{\\rm ref}\\,\\Psi_B^{\\rm ref}},\n$$\n\nwhere $C_{\\rm vac}$ is fixed by $\\mathcal S_Q(\\mathrm{vac},\\mathrm{vac})=1$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 4. Exact coefficient-normalized Q determinant for every pair A,B. ---- *)\nClearAll[measureWeights, determinantRow, determinantAB, psiBReference,\n  cReference, cReferenceAbstract, rawQScalarProduct, vacuumState,\n  vacuumConstant, qScalarProduct, offDiagonalZero, qDiagonal];\n\nmeasureWeights = {1/(2 h^2), -1/h^2, 1/(2 h^2)};\nrowTriple = {{1, 1}, {1, 2}, {2, 1}};\n\ndeterminantRow[A_, B_, {i_, j_}] := Sum[\n   measureWeights[[n + 1]] {\n    -qUp[A, j, n] qDown[B, i, n],\n     qUp[A, j, n] qDown[B, i, n - 1],\n     qUp[A, j, n + 1] qDown[B, i, n]},\n   {n, 0, 2}];\ndeterminantAB[A_, B_] := determinantAB[A, B] =\n  Factor[Det[determinantRow[A, B, #] & /@ rowTriple]];\n\npsiBReference[B_] :=\n  qDown[B, 1, 1] (\n    qDown[B, 1, 0] qDown[B, 2, -1]\n    - qDown[B, 2, 0] qDown[B, 1, -1]);\n\n(* This is the exact coefficient requested: both terms are retained. *)\ncReference[A_] := Factor[(\n    qUp[A, 1, 1] (\n      qUp[A, 1, 0] qUp[A, 2, 1]\n      - qUp[A, 2, 0] qUp[A, 1, 1])\n    - qUp[A, 1, 0] (\n      qUp[A, 1, 0] qUp[A, 2, 2]\n      - qUp[A, 2, 0] qUp[A, 1, 2])\n    )/(4 h^6)];\n\ncReferenceAbstract = (\n    Qup[1, 1] (Qup[1, 0] Qup[2, 1] - Qup[2, 0] Qup[1, 1])\n    - Qup[1, 0] (Qup[1, 0] Qup[2, 2] - Qup[2, 0] Qup[1, 2])\n    )/(4 h^6);\n\nrawQScalarProduct[A_, B_] :=\n  Factor[determinantAB[A, B]/(cReference[A] psiBReference[B])];\nvacuumState = First@FirstPosition[stateWeight, {2, 1, 0}];\nvacuumConstant = Factor[\n  1/rawQScalarProduct[vacuumState, vacuumState]];\n\nqScalarProduct = Table[\n   Factor[vacuumConstant rawQScalarProduct[A, B]],\n   {A, dd}, {B, dd}];\noffDiagonalZero = And @@ Flatten@Table[\n    If[A == B, True, determinantAB[A, B] === 0],\n    {A, dd}, {B, dd}];\nqDiagonal = Diagonal[qScalarProduct];\n\nGrid[{\n  {\"exact coefficient c_A^ref\", cReferenceAbstract},\n  {\"vacuum calibration C_vac\", vacuumConstant},\n  {\"vacuum entry\", qScalarProduct[[vacuumState, vacuumState]]},\n  {\"all 56 cross-state determinants vanish\", offDiagonalZero},\n  {\"Q-determinant scalar-product matrix is diagonal\",\n   DiagonalMatrixQ[qScalarProduct]},\n  {\"diagonal entries\", qDiagonal}\n  }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
